1
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:06,610
I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness

2
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:35,980
That bag... What exactly is in there?

3
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:36,820
Naughty = Happiness

4
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:39,480
You have a little sister 
at home, do you not?

5
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,980
I have a big sister as well.

6
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:47,150
Did the Great Demon Lord tell you?

7
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:50,650
About the incident that 
happened to the Evans family.

8
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,000
Yes, I heard...

9
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:56,670
about your big sister committing a huge crime—

10
00:01:56,670 --> 00:01:58,010
That is not true!

11
00:01:58,380 --> 00:02:00,130
My big sister can't even kill a bug.

12
00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:02,520
She would never do such a thing!

13
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:09,010
I just know that rotten excuse of 
a prince did it to frame my sister!

14
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:14,280
But my family chose to cut 
her out of our family...

15
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:18,290
So you didn't resent your big sister?

16
00:02:18,290 --> 00:02:20,160
Don't be ridiculous!

17
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:23,290
What I cannot stand is the Evans family, and...

18
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:27,440
myself because couldn't save my sister!

19
00:02:29,230 --> 00:02:33,710
My sister has always been kind 
to me ever since I was born.

20
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:40,730
But things changed... and 
I couldn't do anything to help.

21
00:02:41,810 --> 00:02:46,270
That's why I was going to 
rescue her when I grew up.

22
00:02:46,270 --> 00:02:47,760
But I was too late.

23
00:02:48,350 --> 00:02:50,770
My sister disappeared.

24
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:53,240
Natalia...

25
00:02:53,810 --> 00:02:57,670
After that incident, her 
belongings were thrown away,

26
00:02:57,670 --> 00:02:59,570
and the only thing left was this bag.

27
00:02:59,950 --> 00:03:01,680
Thanks to this,

28
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:05,570
I can use my magic to tell that 
my sister is alive somewhere.

29
00:03:05,570 --> 00:03:08,920
Is that a lost article detection spell?

30
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:11,230
I've read about them.

31
00:03:11,230 --> 00:03:12,110
That's right.

32
00:03:12,110 --> 00:03:14,530
I don't know who it is,

33
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:19,520
but I want to crush whoever has 
captured my sister with my own hands!

34
00:03:20,790 --> 00:03:24,950
Why... do you assume that 
your sister is in captivity?

35
00:03:24,950 --> 00:03:29,610
Every time I try it, a strong 
power jams my spell.

36
00:03:29,980 --> 00:03:34,850
I'm sure the creep who confined 
my sister is interfering with it!

37
00:03:34,900 --> 00:03:36,860
HEHEHE

38
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:38,840
Who on earth could it be?

39
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:41,910
I'll find him no matter what, 
and shred him to pieces!

40
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:46,120
<i>A-Allen is going to be shred to pieces!</i>

41
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:49,560
I will locate my sister 
no matter what it takes.

42
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:53,130
And that's why I have to 
become much, much stronger!

43
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:55,750
Have no fear.

44
00:03:55,750 --> 00:03:58,120
You will definitely find your sister.

45
00:03:58,850 --> 00:04:00,210
It's so strange.

46
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:04,900
You're pretty much a stranger I just met,

47
00:04:04,900 --> 00:04:07,390
but it feels like I've 
known you for a long time.

48
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:11,120
That's probably because I...

49
00:04:12,890 --> 00:04:16,310
I'm so sorry, Natalia!

50
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:17,390
Ch-Chris?!

51
00:04:17,390 --> 00:04:19,720
I had no idea you had such a sad past!

52
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:22,000
I am a fool! An idiot!

53
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,810
I'm so sorry!

54
00:04:22,810 --> 00:04:24,300
Please forgive me!

55
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:27,400
Anyhow, we need to get 
out of this dungeon...

56
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:35,680
Is it the magical 
creature from earlier?

57
00:04:43,410 --> 00:04:44,430
A salamander?!

58
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:46,660
Is this the dungeon boss?!

59
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,850
Charlo?!

60
00:04:48,850 --> 00:04:51,170
I'll draw the attention 
of this magical creature.

61
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:54,190
Please go and get Allen in the meantime.

62
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:55,190
You can't!

63
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:57,180
That's a very dangerous magical creature...

64
00:04:57,620 --> 00:04:59,690
I will protect you!

65
00:05:01,290 --> 00:05:02,680
Chris!

66
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,690
Natalia hurt her foot.

67
00:05:04,690 --> 00:05:06,080
Please take her and run!

68
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,800
O-Okay, I will!

69
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,690
I can't!

70
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:11,070
I can't leave you alone, Charlo!

71
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:13,210
You need to listen to me, Natalia!

72
00:05:15,270 --> 00:05:16,330
Please, Chris!

73
00:05:16,730 --> 00:05:18,590
Let's go, Natalia!

74
00:05:19,630 --> 00:05:21,080
<i>It'll be fine.</i>

75
00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:23,550
<i>I'm going to protect Natalia!</i>

76
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:30,060
This way!

77
00:05:31,090 --> 00:05:32,840
Come this way!

78
00:05:37,550 --> 00:05:38,900
Charlo!

79
00:05:41,650 --> 00:05:43,550
B-Big sister?!

80
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,360
Charlo!

81
00:05:48,260 --> 00:05:49,140
Huh?!

82
00:05:57,320 --> 00:06:00,380
Are you the one who hurt Charlotte?!

83
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:08,020
What is this amount of mana?!

84
00:06:08,020 --> 00:06:10,630
This is the power of the 
Great Demon Lord...!

85
00:06:12,630 --> 00:06:15,190
Dad, you don't think this is...?

86
00:06:15,190 --> 00:06:17,890
Yes, it can only be Allen.

87
00:06:18,370 --> 00:06:20,680
I hope the school building stays intact.

88
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,650
Huh?!

89
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:23,640
There's no problem.

90
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:26,310
It's easy to defeat her.

91
00:06:35,030 --> 00:06:36,530
G-Great Demon Lord!

92
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:37,680
Huh?!

93
00:06:39,950 --> 00:06:41,240
Oh, jeez!

94
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:43,050
I said, <i>sit</i>!

95
00:06:43,530 --> 00:06:45,290
What's going on?

96
00:06:45,290 --> 00:06:49,260
Oh no, students aren't 
allowed in here right now.

97
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:52,680
Only me, the magical creature 
teacher, can enter.

98
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,130
Professor Lis!

99
00:06:54,130 --> 00:06:56,940
Salamander is acting strange.

100
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:59,440
Oh my, little Pochi.

101
00:06:59,780 --> 00:07:02,630
You remembered my dear Allen, did you?

102
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:05,810
He's your daddy, because he raised 
you from when you were just an egg.

103
00:07:05,810 --> 00:07:06,930
What?!

104
00:07:12,530 --> 00:07:15,380
<i>Charlotte, you did well.</i>

105
00:07:17,230 --> 00:07:20,280
I'm very sorry, headmaster.

106
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:22,070
It's all my fault.

107
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:24,580
I'll receive any punishment!

108
00:07:24,580 --> 00:07:28,080
Hm, you seem to have grown a bit.

109
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,700
Great Demon Lord, I...

110
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:34,100
Come on, time for the moving reunion.

111
00:07:39,220 --> 00:07:41,110
Allen, I...

112
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:44,350
Look, Natalia is worried about you.

113
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:49,800
I'm glad you're okay, Natalia.

114
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:53,720
Huh?! My glasses? And my hair?! 
It's all back to normal?

115
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:55,500
So you really are...!

116
00:07:58,220 --> 00:08:00,280
I'm sorry for deceiving you.

117
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:04,870
I know I must have caused 
you a lot of trouble.

118
00:08:05,940 --> 00:08:08,180
So I've been wanting to apologize...

119
00:08:08,860 --> 00:08:12,110
My sister! You're my big sister, right?!

120
00:08:12,110 --> 00:08:12,970
Yes.

121
00:08:13,490 --> 00:08:18,510
Then... do you remember the book you 
used to read to me when I was little?

122
00:08:18,930 --> 00:08:21,260
The story about the zoo, right?

123
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:25,830
The one about children heading to the zoo.

124
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:29,980
It was somehow misplaced, so 
 someone must've thrown it away.

125
00:08:31,090 --> 00:08:32,270
Natalia?

126
00:08:33,520 --> 00:08:34,810
Is that...?

127
00:08:34,810 --> 00:08:37,960
It was almost thrown away, so I hid it.

128
00:08:38,730 --> 00:08:46,300
I wanted, I just wanted... for you 
to read this to me one more time.

129
00:08:47,490 --> 00:08:48,540
Natalia!

130
00:08:49,490 --> 00:08:51,680
I'm sorry!

131
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:55,040
I'm so sorry that I couldn't help you!

132
00:08:55,530 --> 00:09:00,560
Me too. I'm sorry I left you all alone.

133
00:09:03,870 --> 00:09:05,630
I'm happy for you, mommy.

134
00:09:05,630 --> 00:09:07,640
A fairy-tale ending.

135
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:13,310
Thank you for everything, Professor Allen.

136
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:15,820
Don't you mean to call me the Great Demon Lord?

137
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:17,830
We owe you a lot.

138
00:09:18,650 --> 00:09:21,560
I never imagined that you'd be the savior.

139
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:24,860
That's right.

140
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:30,410
Allen saved my life, and right now 
he's my precious, you know...

141
00:09:33,250 --> 00:09:34,480
Your precious...?

142
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,390
Boyfriend, right?

143
00:09:36,390 --> 00:09:38,830
These two are dating, indeed.

144
00:09:38,830 --> 00:09:40,100
Huh?

145
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:42,150
N-No, we're not, Natalia.

146
00:09:42,150 --> 00:09:43,520
That was just...

147
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,970
Wh-What's wrong?!

148
00:09:45,230 --> 00:09:47,100
You fricking bastard!

149
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:48,850
What's wrong?! Everything!

150
00:09:48,850 --> 00:09:52,590
So <i>that's</i> why I couldn't locate 
my sister with my spell!

151
00:09:52,590 --> 00:09:54,980
You approached her hoping 
to seduce her, didn't you?!

152
00:09:54,980 --> 00:09:59,880
What the hell have you done to my 
precious sister, you bloody bastard!

153
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:02,120
No! That's a misunderstanding, Natalia!

154
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,860
Don't take it seriously!

155
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:07,100
P-Please! Somebody, stop her!

156
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,130
Just leave them be.

157
00:10:08,130 --> 00:10:12,760
Now that we've come together, 
let's go eat something good.

158
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:13,460
Yay!

159
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:15,380
I'm hungry!

160
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:19,030
We don't want to get roped in, so maybe 
we'll go to the cafeteria as well.

161
00:10:19,030 --> 00:10:22,150
Let me buy you dinner for causing so much trouble.

162
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:27,320
Who knew Allen and Charlotte were 
faking their relationship...

163
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,360
I'm very disappointed.

164
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,400
I'm sorry for lying to you.

165
00:10:31,690 --> 00:10:34,910
But it is true that they love each other.

166
00:10:35,180 --> 00:10:37,040
Shredding you to pieces would be too lenient!

167
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:39,910
I'll finish you right here, right now!

168
00:10:42,710 --> 00:10:48,080
So, until they are ready to tell each other 
how they really feel, let's watch over them.

169
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:53,920
I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness

170
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:56,920
I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness

171
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:02,920
We haven't spent time like this in a while.

172
00:11:03,190 --> 00:11:04,130
Indeed.

173
00:11:04,130 --> 00:11:05,720
It's nice and peaceful.

174
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,440
It really is.

175
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:11,560
<i>Now that we've solved the problem 
and returned to the mansion,</i>

176
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,930
<i>there's one thing that's clouding my mind.</i>

177
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:19,180
<i>That night, why did Charlotte 
want to ask me how I felt?</i>

178
00:11:19,710 --> 00:11:23,620
What were you going to say to me, Allen?

179
00:11:24,690 --> 00:11:29,560
<i>I still want to ask Allen what I 
couldn't ask him the other night.</i>

180
00:11:30,210 --> 00:11:31,710
<i>Right now, there's still time to...</i>

181
00:11:30,210 --> 00:11:31,710
<i>Right now, there's still time to...</i>

182
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:33,950
You know...

183
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:33,950
You know...

184
00:11:35,950 --> 00:11:37,950
Hello, nya!

185
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:43,960
Demon Lord and Lottie, 
long time no see, nya!

186
00:11:44,350 --> 00:11:46,600
It's been a while, Miacha.

187
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,810
I haven't seen you since Episode 6.

188
00:11:48,810 --> 00:11:50,030
What are you doing here?

189
00:11:50,030 --> 00:11:52,490
Delivering you a package, nya!

190
00:11:54,410 --> 00:11:57,400
Brought to you by Miacha of 
Satyros Shipping Company, nya!

191
00:11:58,110 --> 00:12:00,100
Leave from the main entrance!

192
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:05,060
Allen, this package doesn't 
say who it's from.

193
00:12:05,060 --> 00:12:07,580
I wonder who it could be...

194
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,820
Is that a magic circle?

195
00:12:09,820 --> 00:12:11,210
Yes. Let's see...

196
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,190
Allen?!

197
00:12:17,190 --> 00:12:19,120
Is it summoning magic?!

198
00:12:19,420 --> 00:12:20,630
Summoning...

199
00:12:20,630 --> 00:12:22,380
Stay back, Charlotte!

200
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,900
Big sister!

201
00:12:27,890 --> 00:12:29,900
How have you been, my dear sister?!

202
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:31,000
Natalia?!

203
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:31,900
But why...?

204
00:12:32,230 --> 00:12:34,720
Operation: Surprise was a great success!

205
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,910
Yes, nya!

206
00:12:35,910 --> 00:12:40,660
Eruca, Miacha, what do you 
mean by Operation: Surprise?

207
00:12:40,660 --> 00:12:44,260
Natalia told me she wanted 
to come visit you.

208
00:12:44,260 --> 00:12:48,310
I thought we should take this chance and 
surprise you, so I asked Miacha to help me.

209
00:12:48,310 --> 00:12:50,170
That's how it happened, nya.

210
00:12:50,170 --> 00:12:53,150
Thank you for your cooperation.

211
00:12:54,650 --> 00:12:57,060
So, where is the Great Demon Lord?

212
00:12:57,060 --> 00:13:00,830
If he isn't around, I can have my big 
sister all to myself so I wouldn't mind.

213
00:13:00,830 --> 00:13:02,660
I am right here.

214
00:13:03,870 --> 00:13:06,680
I see you still haven't kicked the bucket.

215
00:13:07,060 --> 00:13:11,920
Then to encourage you to give up my sister,
perhaps I should take your life right now...

216
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:14,250
Wha... It's a misunderstanding!

217
00:13:14,250 --> 00:13:16,250
And fighting is naughty!

218
00:13:16,250 --> 00:13:18,000
Oh, you're mistaken, big sister.

219
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:21,340
This is a passionate communication 
from a beloved disciple.

220
00:13:21,850 --> 00:13:23,700
Who's the beloved disciple?

221
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:25,530
What nonsense.

222
00:13:25,950 --> 00:13:28,350
The master of this mansion is me.

223
00:13:28,350 --> 00:13:30,640
If you can't listen to 
the owner of the house,

224
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,950
then I wouldn't mind 
kicking you out by force!

225
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:35,450
Couldn't ask for anything better.

226
00:13:36,510 --> 00:13:38,450
Oh no, oh no, oh no, oh no...

227
00:13:38,890 --> 00:13:41,120
I need your help!

228
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,080
Dorothea?!

229
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:44,130
It's been a while, Miss Charlotte!

230
00:13:44,130 --> 00:13:46,350
Sorry to barge in!

231
00:13:46,350 --> 00:13:47,800
D-Dorothea?

232
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:52,760
You mean <i>the</i> Dorothea Gri’mm Wallenstein?!

233
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:53,960
That's me.

234
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,860
Nya nya!

235
00:13:54,860 --> 00:13:59,100
She's the very famous author who 
has published a lot of novels!

236
00:13:59,100 --> 00:14:02,070
I've heard of your name, too...

237
00:14:02,070 --> 00:14:05,000
Man, this is making me blush.

238
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,680
And where is Mister Allen?

239
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:08,340
I am... right here...

240
00:14:12,110 --> 00:14:14,940
It's been a while, Mister Allen.

241
00:14:14,940 --> 00:14:17,860
I got a souvenir for you. My new novel.

242
00:14:18,140 --> 00:14:22,200
Big sister, how do you know this novelist?

243
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:25,140
She used to live in this mansion.

244
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:27,280
Exactly.

245
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:31,420
I wrote my new novel with 
the help of these two,

246
00:14:31,420 --> 00:14:33,620
and it's a huge hit.

247
00:14:33,890 --> 00:14:39,140
I'm hoping to write a sequel soon. Have 
there been any developments since then?

248
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:41,320
Well, that's...

249
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,160
Developments?

250
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:44,890
And what did you come here for?

251
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:46,660
I'm in trouble!

252
00:14:46,660 --> 00:14:51,140
My editor, Yor, has been relentlessly 
asking about the sequel...

253
00:14:51,140 --> 00:14:53,780
So I'd like for you to hide me here!

254
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:55,100
I refuse!

255
00:14:55,100 --> 00:14:57,740
I don't want him breaking the wall again.

256
00:14:57,740 --> 00:14:59,180
Please!

257
00:14:59,180 --> 00:15:01,200
She needs your help, nya! Demon Lord!

258
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,930
That's right, bro!

259
00:15:02,930 --> 00:15:07,540
Natalia is staying here tonight, so one 
more person wouldn't make a difference.

260
00:15:07,540 --> 00:15:09,950
Why do you assume that Natalia is staying?!

261
00:15:09,950 --> 00:15:11,050
It's to be expected!

262
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:16,070
I must keep my eyes on you, so you won't 
do anything naughty to my sister!

263
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:18,500
Natalia, you're staying here?

264
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:20,290
Let's play a lot!

265
00:15:20,290 --> 00:15:22,930
It looks like it's going 
to be lively tonight.

266
00:15:22,930 --> 00:15:26,060
I shall cook up my secret recipe for you.

267
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:29,070
Stop organizing things 
without my permission!

268
00:15:29,070 --> 00:15:32,190
Gosetsu, I didn't know you could cook!

269
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:36,820
I suppose we could enjoy a dinner together.

270
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,910
Yes!

271
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:01,080
<i>Where am I?</i>

272
00:16:01,930 --> 00:16:03,510
<i>That's right.</i>

273
00:16:03,510 --> 00:16:07,600
<i>Mother misunderstood and thought I 
stole something from the house.</i>

274
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:14,200
<i>I'm scared, so scared.</i>

275
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,620
<i>I don't like darkness.</i>

276
00:16:16,270 --> 00:16:18,040
<i>I don't like pain.</i>

277
00:16:18,040 --> 00:16:20,230
<i>And being lonely is even worse.</i>

278
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:25,040
<i>But there's no one who will hurt me here.</i>

279
00:16:26,430 --> 00:16:29,560
<i>I can breathe easier in here than outside.</i>

280
00:16:30,210 --> 00:16:32,990
<i>If I can get swallowed up in 
the darkness like this...</i>

281
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,970
Charlotte.

282
00:16:35,860 --> 00:16:37,030
Charlotte.

283
00:16:37,430 --> 00:16:38,710
Charlotte.

284
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:50,290
Wh-Who are you?

285
00:16:52,070 --> 00:16:53,750
I'm the Great Demon Lord.

286
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:57,040
I've come to take you away.

287
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:18,500
<i>It's been a while since I last had 
a nightmare from back then.</i>

288
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:21,700
<i>But...</i>

289
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:27,070
Hm? What's the matter?

290
00:17:27,390 --> 00:17:29,800
I couldn't stay asleep.

291
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:32,310
Are you still working, Allen?

292
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:36,990
Well, since I was working till late, 
my brain is still too wound up.

293
00:17:36,990 --> 00:17:38,330
You can't go to sleep?

294
00:17:38,330 --> 00:17:40,810
May I stay here with you?

295
00:17:40,810 --> 00:17:41,860
Sure.

296
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:46,220
Ah, this is a good chance to try <i>that</i> out.

297
00:17:46,220 --> 00:17:47,080
What is it?

298
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:52,580
Of course it's... a naughty 
thing you can only do at night.

299
00:17:52,940 --> 00:17:55,590
Only at night...?

300
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:08,610
Here. It's hot, so be careful.

301
00:18:08,890 --> 00:18:10,450
It smells so good.

302
00:18:10,450 --> 00:18:11,620
Is this hot cocoa?

303
00:18:11,620 --> 00:18:13,120
Indeed.

304
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:16,300
Let's enjoy stargazing as we drink it.

305
00:18:20,950 --> 00:18:24,180
This is the naughty thing 
you can only do at night?

306
00:18:24,180 --> 00:18:25,330
It's wonderful!

307
00:18:25,630 --> 00:18:30,420
Although I say stargazing, I 
don't know much about stars.

308
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:33,390
But you know everything!

309
00:18:33,390 --> 00:18:37,350
I am very familiar with the effect of 
the positions of the stars on mana.

310
00:18:37,350 --> 00:18:40,910
But I know next to nothing about 
constellations and myths.

311
00:18:40,910 --> 00:18:42,890
That sounds very much like you, Allen.

312
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:48,400
Um, the one shining in yellow is the 
eye of the Spider constellation.

313
00:18:48,670 --> 00:18:52,330
Below that on the right is the 
constellation of the hell capybara.

314
00:18:52,330 --> 00:18:53,390
Hmm...

315
00:18:53,710 --> 00:18:57,400
They just look like a bunch of stars to me.

316
00:18:58,360 --> 00:18:59,400
Oh!

317
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,790
Something sparkled!

318
00:19:01,790 --> 00:19:03,330
Perhaps a shooting star?

319
00:19:03,330 --> 00:19:05,320
Hm? Where?

320
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:09,260
Allen?

321
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:17,420
You don't... mind it?

322
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:22,180
No, I've never minded it, not even once.

323
00:19:23,610 --> 00:19:24,620
Is that so?

324
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:39,200
Allen.

325
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:39,860
Hm?

326
00:19:40,340 --> 00:19:42,560
Thank you for everything.

327
00:19:46,610 --> 00:19:49,620
Drinking sweet hot cocoa as 
you gaze up at the stars...

328
00:19:50,390 --> 00:19:52,850
It is very naughty.

329
00:19:52,850 --> 00:19:54,970
This is nothing.

330
00:19:54,970 --> 00:19:55,920
Huh?

331
00:19:56,740 --> 00:20:02,160
I told you that I'd give you a crash course 
on all things naughty in the world.

332
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,400
I don't mean just this.

333
00:20:05,590 --> 00:20:09,660
Recently, I'm excited for 
the morning to come.

334
00:20:10,300 --> 00:20:14,990
To see what kind of happy things 
you're going to teach me.

335
00:20:15,890 --> 00:20:19,260
I'm glad to have met you.

336
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:27,310
Put your blanket on, or you'll catch a cold.

337
00:20:27,310 --> 00:20:29,790
Oh, thank you.

338
00:20:34,850 --> 00:20:36,240
Allen...

339
00:20:38,090 --> 00:20:39,650
Charlotte...

340
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:51,380
I know you're there, idiots!

341
00:20:52,540 --> 00:20:54,000
Oh boy, you knew?!

342
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,260
As expected of the Demon Lord.

343
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:58,760
The heat between you two was hot enough 
to forget the cold night, nya.

344
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:02,200
Whispering words of love under 
a beautiful starry sky...

345
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:04,480
Master Allen sure is a tactician.

346
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:07,830
Stop monopolizing mommy just 
because everyone's asleep!

347
00:21:07,070 --> 00:21:07,830
Exactly!

348
00:21:07,830 --> 00:21:10,170
I-I didn't mean to...!

349
00:21:10,170 --> 00:21:11,800
Are you sure?

350
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:16,280
If that's the case, why are 
you still holding hands?

351
00:21:16,280 --> 00:21:17,600
Great Demon Lord!

352
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:22,300
I must tear your hand off so I 
can remove you from my sister!

353
00:21:22,300 --> 00:21:24,230
Stop being so violent!

354
00:21:24,230 --> 00:21:25,870
I'll defeat Allen, too!

355
00:21:25,870 --> 00:21:27,680
Mommy is mine!

356
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:28,860
Sounds good.

357
00:21:28,860 --> 00:21:30,810
I shall help.

358
00:21:30,810 --> 00:21:32,820
I don't even care anymore!

359
00:21:32,820 --> 00:21:33,550
Bring it on!

360
00:21:33,550 --> 00:21:36,500
I'll take on all of you!

361
00:21:42,070 --> 00:21:49,950
I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness

362
00:21:49,990 --> 00:21:52,080
Here's the report from our spy.

363
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:54,920
We finally have her location.

364
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:56,070
Good.

365
00:21:56,860 --> 00:22:01,080
In the name of the Neruz Kingdom, 
we must capture her at once.

366
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:02,180
Yes, Your Royal Highness!

367
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:07,470
Just you wait... Charlotte.

